 "words": 172,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "They traveled through the island to Paphos",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Found a Jewish magician and false prophet",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Named Bar-Jesus with the proconsul",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sergius Paulus an intelligent man",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The proconsul sent for Barnabas and Saul",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Eager to hear the word of God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You are full of every kind of deceit",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You son of the devil and fraud",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Enemy of all that is right",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Twisting the straight paths of the Lord",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But Elymas the magician opposed them",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Trying to turn the proconsul away",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the faith he sought to find",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saul looked straight at him with power",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Filled with the Holy Spirit in that moment",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You are full of every kind of deceit",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You son of the devil and fraud",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Enemy of all that is right",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Twisting the straight paths of the Lord",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The hand of the Lord is against you",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You will be blind and unable to see",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A mist and darkness came over him",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He groped about seeking a hand to lead",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the proconsul saw what had happened",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He believed astounded at the teaching",
